bun audit reports no advisory for @hyzyla/pdfium 3.0.0 or pngjs 7.0.0.
It reports deepmerge 4.3.1 (low, prototype poisoning) and minimatch 10.2.6
(moderate, glob amplification). Both are reachable only through the web
package's development-only shadcn tooling and are absent from the harness
bundle. This is a point-in-time review; refresh it with bun audit when the
lockfile changes.
